t callsite. Before choosing an optimization, this comparison separates the current reader's source loading, saved-policy loading and own replay.\n\n## Change\n\nA private observer measures only the three named `compact_suit.cli` aliases during the original three complete reads: seven disjoint calls, capped at 16. Reusable scientific functions and all 436 preceding source files remain unchanged. The complete audit keeps all 432 profiles, 1,152 fixed conditions, three reference workers, startup, checks and final writes.\n\nThe own-only proof distinguishes actual archived fictional-game replay from synthetic forwarding fixtures. Data-only readers check raw inventories, complete calculated results, ownership, restoration and clock bounds; reports have a fresh output-folder option. Existing source and numerical tolerances remain intact.\n\n[Prospective plan](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/issues/4#issuecomment-6914870507), [method](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/4bef6ae03a396441102b390d760c7409d68441ea/docs/reader-phase-cpu.md), and learning journal step 127 describe the scope. Closing PR #82 verification is included in this substantive batch.\n\n## Local checks\n\nImmutable head `4bef6ae03a396441102b390d760c7409d68441ea`, 439-file fingerprint `39b5f696d15ed9994f190a5c928f030bbc348eb328103f451797c000146693bf`; actual Python3.11.17/NumPy2.4.6 and Python3.12.15/NumPy2.5.4, complete source/import guards before and after.\n\n| Role | Actual result |\n| --- | --- |\n| base311 | 4887 passed, 66 skipped, 150 deselected in 648.19s (0:10:48) |\n| base312 | 4887 passed, 66 skipped, 150 deselected in 616.01s (0:10:16) |\n| optional311 | 1791 passed in 337.25s (0:05:37) |\n| optional312 | 1791 passed in 278.26s (0:04:38) |\n\nRuff, full strict typing, hooks, and relative documentation paths/anchors/images pass. The first combined optional cohort caught two own-only tests running after another test imported the reference into the parent. The original guard correctly refused that process. Those tests now use fresh subprocesses; a deliberate reference-preloaded-parent regression passes all five cases on each runtime. Full failed logs/source and corrected test records remain in qualification history. No guard was relaxed.\n\n## Remaining stages\n\nBoth hosted jobs must qualify this exact source, with actual interpreter/all uv/entire-tree verification, before all six receipts and tested operators are published. Then publish the fresh own-only proof before constructing the fresh reference; retain and publish one fixed complete raw pair before analysis. Saved-data reproduction, inspected figures and final local/hosted verification precede merge. This PR stays draft through those stages; no formal phase capture has run.\n\n## Limits\n\nFixed caps remain 180 seconds for the proof, 900 per complete child and 1,800 shared; 120 seconds only saves a failure. OpenSpiel2.0.2/Apache2.0 stays comparison-only. One ordered pair cannot establish stable overhead or a causal speedup. Diagnostic clocks do not replace production costs: the 912.5424664160237/900 forecast and 2.390%/1% accuracy gates remain failed. No new Hold'em trajectory, stronger/default/fresh/global promotion or competitive full-game strength claim.\n\nImplementation, checks and explanations are Codex-assisted. Human hands-on time is not recorded. Continues #4.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-16T12:41:03Z","updated_at":"2026-11-16T12:41:03Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ca7d1b2623c4d244d032224a42b6e46ec2a58c1a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jimmy-sim:research/reader-phase-cpu","ref":"research/reader-phase-cpu","repo":{"id":1444975151,"node_id":"R_kgDOViCSLw","name":"poker-ai","full_name":"jimmy-sim/poker-ai","owner":{"login":"jimmy-sim","id":77947780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQ3Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77947780